{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07289","headline":"同诸公袁郎中宴筵喜加章服 · 刘长卿","name":"同诸公袁郎中宴筵喜加章服","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手诏来筵上，腰金向粉闱。\n勳名传旧阁，蹈舞着新衣。\n白社同游在，沧洲此会稀。\n寒笳发後殿，秋草送西归。\n世难常摧敌，时闲已息机。\n鲁连功可让，千载一相挥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}